[[!meta title="Energy Drink — Ghost Energy x A&W Root Beer"]]
[[!tag Review Energy_Drink]]

They released this one yesterday, August 31 2026, which is the same day I bought
it when I went to the convenience store on a whim. Their distribution network is
insane, considering this was at a gas station in rural NC same-day.

<figure>
[[!template id="hooya-img.tmpl" cid="bafkreib7budnroddv6unouai6ekrkk5v33jdu2zjnrvee2gq65sotolpwy" size=medium]]
</figure>

It looks like root beer. It tastes like root beer. But it's not root beer. It's
a zero-sugar Ghost with 200mg of caffeine. What the fuck.

